{"strongs": "H6256", "word": "עֵת", "translit": "et", "root": "ענב", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "time", "definition": "עֵת 297 noun feminine Amos 5:13 and (seldom, mostly late) masculine Ezra 10:14 time (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician עת ; Assyrian inu, ittu , time ; Talmud עַנְתָּא ; clearly from a √ ענה , but doubtful whether I. ׳ ע ); — absolute ׳ ע Hos 10:12 +, construct ׳ ע Gen 24:12 + עֶתֿ Lev 15:25 + 5t.; suffix עִתּוֺ Hos 2:11 +, etc.; plural, late, עִתִּים 1Chr 12:32 +, suffix עִתֶּיךָ , Isa 33:6 עִתּוֺת Ps 9:10 ; Ps 10:1 , suffix עִתֹּתָ֑י Ps 31:16 — ׳ ע only twice P , once H ; — 1. time of an event, etc.: \\ \\ a. usually (213 t.) with preposition: with בְּ (142 t.), especially הַהִוא ׳ בָּע Gen 21:22 ( E ) in that time , Gen 38:1 ( J ), Num 22:4 ( E ), Deut 1:9 + 14 t. Deuteronomy; הַהִיא ׳ בָּע Josh 5:2 ; Amos 5:13 ; Dan 12:1 (twice in verse). + (69 t., not in P ); הַזּאֹת ׳ בָּע Esth 4:14 , בָּעִתִּים הָהֵם 2Chr 15:5 ; Dan 11:14 בְּכָלעֵֿת at all times Exod 18:22 ; Exod 18:26 ( E ), Lev 16:2 ( P ) Ps 34:2 +; = continually Prov 8:30 , בְּכָלעֵֿת אֲשֶׁר Esth 5:13 as long as I see Mordecai; with לְ (31 t.; compare ל 6 , p. 516 above), 2Sam 11:1 + at the time , but Ezek 12:27 for distant times , compare לְעֵת כָּזֹאת Esth 4:14 , etc.; with כְּ (21 t.; compare כ 1 a , p. 453 above), הַזּאֹת ׳ מָחָר כָּע Josh 11:6 ( J E ) tomorrow about this time , usually מָחָר ׳ כָּע ( Kö Synt. 401 o ) Exod 9:18 ( J ), 1Sam 9:16 (compare Dr ), 1Sam 20:12 ; 1Kgs 19:2 ; 1Kgs 20:6 ; 2Kgs 7:1 ; 2Kgs 7:18 ; 2Kgs 10:6 ; כָּעֵת חַיָה ; כָּעֵת הָרִאשׁוֺן Isa 8:23 at the former time ; כָּעֵת alone Num 23:23 ( J E ) at this time = now (probably, compare Di ), Judg 13:23 ; Judg 21:22 , etc.; with מִן (8 t.), מִן הָעֵת הַהִא Neh 13:21 , etc.; with עַד (12 t.), הַהִיא ׳ עַדהָֿע Neh 6:1 up to that time , מֵעֵת עַדעֵֿת Ezek 4:10 ; Ezek 4:11 etc. (5 t. Daniel); with אלֿ , מֵעֵת אֶלעֵֿת 1Chr 9:25 . b often construct defined by n.following: בְּעֵת צָהֳרָ֑יִם Jer 20:16 , לְעֵת (הָ)עֶרֶב 2Sam 11:12 ; Gen 8:11 ; Gen 24:11 (both J ), Isa 17:14 ; Zech 14:7 עַדעֵֿת הָעָ֑רֶב Josh 8:29 ( J E ), כְּעֵת מִנְחַת עֶרֶב Dan 9:21 , redundantly לְעֶתיֿוֺם בְּיוֺם 1Chr 12:22 , (ה)קָצִיר ׳ ע Jer 50:16 ; Jer 51:33 , הַוָּמִיר ׳ ע Song 2:12 , וִקְנָה ׳ ע 1Kgs 11:4 ; 1Kgs 15:23 ; Ps 71:9 , אַפְּךָ ׳ בְּע Jer 18:23 = פָּנְיךָ ׳ לְע Ps 21:10 (of anger), לְעִתּוֺת בַּצָּרָה Ps 9:10 ; Ps 10:1 at time destitution (see בַּצָּרָה ), etc. \\ \\ c. followed by infinitive בּוֺא הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ ׳ לְע Josh 10:27 ( J E ), 2Chr 18:34 , קָרְאָם ׳ בְּע Jer 11:14 a (read בְּעֵת also v b, Gie ), etc. \\ \\ d. followed by clause with finite verb (in poetry or late) Deut 32:35 ; Job 6:17 ; 2Chr 20:22 ; 2Chr 24:11 ; 2Chr 29:27 + (compare 2 c ). 2. a. = usual time: צֵאת ׳ לְע 2Sam 11:1 at time of kings' going forth = 1Chr 20:1 בְּעֵת יַחֵם Gen 31:10 עֵת לֶדֶת Job 39:1 ; Job 39:2 . \\ \\ b. proper, suitable time: rain בְּעִתּוֺ Deut 11:14 ; Jer 5:24 +, compare Lev 26:4 ( H ), also Ps 1:3 ; Ps 104:27 ; Ps 145:15 ; Prov 15:23 ; Isa 60:22 ; Eccl 3:11 עֵת מִלְחָמָה v Eccl 3:8 שָׁלוֺם ׳ ע v Eccl 3:8 followed by infinitive Hos 10:12 , הַעֵת לָקַחַת 2Kgs 5:26 is it a time to take money? Hag 1:4 , עֶתבֵּֿית לְהִבָּנוֺת ׳ י v Hag 1:2 (v:a read עַתָּ בָּא Hi We Now and others); עֵת לַעֲשׂוֺת Ps 119:126 , compare Eccl 3:2-8 (26 t.); absolute כִּי עֵת Hos 13:13 ( Hi We and others; Gu Kau gives עַתָּ ; > Now כָּעֵת ); absolute with negative Job 22:16 ; Eccl 7:17 hence (late) יוֺדְעֵי בִינָה לָעִתִּים 1Chr 12:32 , יִדְעֵי הָעִתִּים Esth 1:13 i.e. astrologers, etc. \\ \\ c. appointed time , ׳ בְּעֵת תֵּת וגו 1Sam 18:19 at the appointed time of giving , Ezek 7:7 ; Ezek 7:12 ; Isa 13:22 , פְּקֻדָּתָם ׳ ע Jer 8:12 ; Jer 10:15 = Jer 51:18 ; Jer 46:21 ; Jer 50:27 compare (with finite verb) Jer 6:15 ; Jer 49:8 ; Jer 50:31 , אַרְצוֺ ׳ ע Jer 27:7 , גּוֺיִם ׳ ע Ezek 30:3 , לְעִתִּים מְזֻמָּנִים Ezra 10:14 ; Neh 10:35 compare Neh 13:31 מוֺעֵד ׳ עַדעֿ 2Sam 24:15 ; Ps 103:14 (|| מוֺעֵד ), etc.; compare עֵת וּמִשְׁפָּט Eccl 8:5 ; Eccl 8:6 (for time of judgment ), עִתּוֺ Eccl 9:12 especially לְעֵת קֵץ Dan 8:7 compare Dan 11:35 ; Dan 11:40 ; Dan 12:4 ; Dan 12:9 , עֲוֺן קֵץ ׳ כְּע Ezek 21:30 ; Ezek 21:34 compare Ezek 35:5 לְקֵץ הָעִתִּים Dan 11:13 . \\ \\ d. as uncertain עֵת וָפֶגַע Eccl 9:11 . 3. = experiences, fortunes , plural אֱמוּנַת עִתֶּיךָ Isa 33:6 ; Ps 31:16 הָעִתִּים אֲשֶׁר עָֽבְרוּ עָלָיו 1Chr 29:30 4. occurrence, occasions (= פַּעַם ), רַבּוֺת עִתִּים Neh 9:28 great numbers of times (= very often).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6197')\">BDB6197</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6256')\">H6256</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6196')\">BDB6196</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6198')\">BDB6198</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֵת</bdbheb><sub>297</sub> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Amos 5:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,13)\">Amos 5:13</ref></sup> and (seldom, mostly late) <b>masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ezra 10:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,14)\">Ezra 10:14</ref></sup> <highlightword>time</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Phoenician <bdbheb>עת</bdbheb>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>inu, ittu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>time</highlight>; Talmud <bdbheb>עַנְתָּא</bdbheb>; clearly from a √ <bdbheb>ענה</bdbheb>, but doubtful whether I. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> ); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:12\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,12)\">Hos 10:12</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,12)\">Gen 24:12</ref> + <bdbheb>עֶתֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 15:25\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,25)\">Lev 15:25</ref> + 5t.; suffix <bdbheb>עִתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 2:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,11)\">Hos 2:11</ref> +, etc.; plural, late, <bdbheb>עִתִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:32\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,32)\">1Chr 12:32</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>עִתֶּיךָ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 33:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,6)\">Isa 33:6</ref> <bdbheb>עִתּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 9:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,9,10)\">Ps 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 10:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,1)\">Ps 10:1</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>עִתֹּתָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 31:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,16)\">Ps 31:16</ref> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> only twice <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, once <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>time</highlight> of an event, etc.: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> usually (213 t.) with preposition: with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> (142 t.), especially <bdbheb>הַהִוא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בָּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 21:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,22)\">Gen 21:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>in that time</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 38:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,38,1)\">Gen 38:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 22:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,4)\">Num 22:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 1:9\" b=\"5\" cBegi